    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d259-a8">

                <pb facs="0617" n="521" xml:id="pg521"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Exhibit F.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extracts from tariff of Victoria,
                    1877.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Twenty per cent. ad valorem.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">articles of apparel.</hi></p>
                <p>Aprons, breeches, coats, capes, cloaks, furs, frocks, hoods, and hats, bobs,
                    jackets, mantles, scarfs, night-dresses, petticoats, ruffles, robes, shirts of
                    all kinds, stays, shawls, trowsers, vests, men’s, women’s, and children’s
                    underclothing, silks of all kinds and in part.</p>
                <p>Carriages and carts, furniture, agricultural implements, machinery, manufactures
                    of metals of all kinds, manufactured stationery, musical instruments, wooden
                    ware of all kinds.</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Ten per cent. ad valorem.</hi></p>
                <p>Carpeting and druggeting, clocks, combs, gloves, watches, woolen piece goods.</p>
                <p>Almonds, bacon, biscuits, 2<hi rendition="#italic">d</hi>. per pound; ale,
                    porter, and other beer, 9<hi rendition="#italic">d</hi>. per gallon; bags and
                    sacks, 1<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per dozen; boots and shoes (men’s),
                        25<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per dozen pairs; do. do., youths’, 15<hi
                        rendition="#italic">s</hi>. do. do.; do. do. (boys’), 11<hi
                        rendition="#italic">s</hi>. do. do.; do. do. (women’s), do. do.; playing
                    cards, 3<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per dozen packs; china ware, 9<hi
                        rendition="#italic">d</hi>. per cubic foot; cigars, 5<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >s</hi>. per pound; doors, 5<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. each; aloes,
                        12<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per hundred weight; chlorodyne, 1<hi
                        rendition="#italic">s</hi>. 4<hi rendition="#italic">d</hi>. per pound;
                    morphia, 1<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. 6<hi rendition="#italic">d</hi>. per
                    ounce; potassium, 10<hi rendition="#italic">d</hi>. per pound; earthenware, 9<hi
                        rendition="#italic">d</hi>. per cubic foot; lead, 2<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >s</hi>. 6<hi rendition="#italic">d</hi>. per hundred weight; matches per
                    gross (boxes containing 100), 6<hi rendition="#italic">d.</hi>; nails (common),
                        3<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per hundred weight; horseshoes, 12<hi
                        rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per hundred weight; oils, 6<hi
                        rendition="#italic">d</hi>. per gallon; oat meal, 3<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >s</hi>. per hundred pounds; onions, 20<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per
                    ton; parasols and sun-shades (silk), 1<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. 9<hi
                        rendition="#italic">9</hi>. each; paints (ground in oil), 40<hi
                        rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per ton; powder, 3<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >d</hi>. per pound; sugar and molasses, 3<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per
                    hundred weight; spirits, liquors, and cordials, 10<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >s</hi>. per gallon; perfumed spirits, 20<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per
                    gallon; tobacco (manufactured), 2<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per pound; do.
                    unmanufactured, 1<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per pound; wines 4<hi
                        rendition="#italic">s</hi>. and 6<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per
                    gallon.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
